## Degraded

- `checkpoint_restore_handoff` `fail_closed`: checkpoint restore handoff still carries fail-closed or manual-review drift. Respect the checkpoint restore escalation band and top restore action before resuming from a saved checkpoint.
- `execution_queue_advisory` `warning`: execution queue advisory is conservative, blocked, or coupled to restore drift. Execution queue runner artifacts are present and risk budget permits advisory queue use.
- `collision_risk` `reserved_overlap`: planned work may collide with another agent or dirty surface. Coordinate with listed agents or use safe alternatives before editing.
